---
import { SITE, editorialByline } from '../config/site';
---
<section class="author-bio" aria-label="About the author">
  <span class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0e5a5e" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3.5 19a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11 0"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.4"/><path d="M15.5 14.2A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 21 18.5"/></svg>
  </span>
  <div>
    <p class="name">Written by the {editorialByline}</p>
    <p>The {SITE.editorialTeam} researches, writes, fact-checks and updates every page on {SITE.name}. We build each page from CDC, USPSTF and WHO guidance, cite our sources, and re-check pages whenever that guidance changes. We are health writers and editors, not clinicians, so we explain your options and point you to licensed care. <a href="/editorial-team/">More about the team</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
